        "id": "click-help-option-api",
        "oracle_root": "oracles",
        "prompt": "Consolidate Click's duplicated built-in help-option behavior into a reusable public click.HelpOption class derived from Option. It should default to --help, an eager flag that prints help and exits without passing a value to the command. Use the same class for automatically generated command help and the help_option decorator. Preserve custom option names, disabled automatic help, resilient parsing, existing help output/color behavior, explicit option keyword overrides (including callback), and the decorator's custom cls support. Keep existing applications working and add focused tests. Work only in this repository; do not look up the upstream implementation or use the network. Run relevant local tests and summarize the change.",
